WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:38.890
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:39.160 --> 01:41.640
[Episode 13]

3
01:41.640 --> 01:46.280
[Nanhuai Army General Staff]

4
01:46.280 --> 01:49.437
Although the gold mine affair has been explained to the central government,

5
01:49.437 --> 01:52.840
we still haven't found out Jun Guan's real identity.

6
01:52.840 --> 01:55.680
- Father, please punish me. - Bing Wen, don't worry about it.

7
01:56.640 --> 01:57.997
What do you mean?

8
01:57.997 --> 02:01.057
I've already found this Jun Guan in the army.

9
02:03.560 --> 02:04.920
Who is it?

10
02:04.920 --> 02:08.041
Jiang Xue Ting, the translator and secretary of the 9th Corps.

11
02:21.400 --> 02:22.800
Xue Ting.

12
02:22.800 --> 02:25.860
What's your plan for the future?

13
02:26.719 --> 02:28.860
I've found a few like-minded friends.

14
02:28.860 --> 02:32.319
We want to start a new publication that truly speaks for the people.

15
02:33.719 --> 02:35.080
And then?

16
02:35.659 --> 02:38.480
Once you graduate, we'll leave Nanhuai.

17
02:38.480 --> 02:40.400
We'll get away from all this trouble.

18
02:40.400 --> 02:45.080
By then, I'll rent a small house with a huge yard.

19
02:46.000 --> 02:47.900
It must have plenty of sunlight.

20
02:47.900 --> 02:51.780
That way, Auntie can enjoy the sun in the yard every day.

21
02:51.780 --> 02:53.080
And you...

22
02:54.680 --> 02:58.780
You can fill the yard with your favorite plantain lilies.

23
03:03.720 --> 03:04.746
Ping Jun.

24
03:05.319 --> 03:11.426
I promise you and Auntie a truly peaceful and comfortable life.

25
03:16.580 --> 03:21.199
I visited several shops before I settled on this one.

26
03:30.740 --> 03:34.659
I wonder... if you'll like it.

27
03:44.680 --> 03:47.280
If it's too plain, I can exchange it at the silver shop.

28
03:47.280 --> 03:48.360
No.

29
03:51.719 --> 03:53.360
I like it very much.

30
04:01.620 --> 04:03.060
Let me put it on for you.

31
04:39.500 --> 04:42.120
Director Gu, what's going on here?

32
04:43.520 --> 04:46.404
Jiang Xue Ting, translator and secretary of the 9th Corps General Staff.

33
04:46.404 --> 04:51.600
You're under arrest for stealing military secrets and defecting to the enemy.

34
04:56.220 --> 04:59.400
Director Gu, are you sure you're not mistaken?

35
04:59.400 --> 05:03.200
Secretary Jiang knows very well whether I'm mistaken.

36
05:04.279 --> 05:05.613
Xue Ting.

37
05:11.240 --> 05:12.520
Ping Jun.

38
05:14.120 --> 05:15.399
I'm sorry.

39
05:16.720 --> 05:18.019
Take him away.

40
05:20.699 --> 05:21.793
Move!

41
06:22.639 --> 06:23.899
Relax.

42
06:25.480 --> 06:26.980
I wasn't going to do anything.

43
06:28.240 --> 06:32.920
After all, you put a lot of effort into this.

44
06:38.319 --> 06:40.240
Is your wound better?

45
06:41.880 --> 06:43.361
It's nothing serious.

46
06:45.120 --> 06:46.620
Let me see.

47
06:55.540 --> 06:57.606
It's healing quite fast.

48
06:58.819 --> 07:00.306
Looks like...

49
07:01.300 --> 07:03.826
someone has applied medicine to you.

50
07:05.620 --> 07:06.720
I'm a grown man.

51
07:06.720 --> 07:09.760
A small wound like this is nothing.

52
07:12.080 --> 07:13.380
Brother.

53
07:15.160 --> 07:18.199
Since when did you get so good at acting?

54
07:20.500 --> 07:24.699
I was almost fooled by your act.

55
07:50.840 --> 07:52.281
Do you remember?

56
07:52.950 --> 07:59.440
In the past, Mother made noodles on your birthday every year.

57
07:59.440 --> 08:04.000
Father and I would go out to buy you this ginger candy in any weather.

58
08:04.000 --> 08:05.120
- Qiao. - Brother!

59
08:05.120 --> 08:07.404
- You're back. - Here.

60
08:07.404 --> 08:11.100
Father and I checked out many alleys before we finally found this. Try it.

61
08:11.879 --> 08:13.300
It's ginger candy.

62
08:37.520 --> 08:39.179
Of course I remember that.

63
08:43.200 --> 08:48.220
But those happy days are gone for good.

64
08:50.059 --> 08:54.879
No matter how bitter the old days were, they still feel sweet.

65
08:56.620 --> 08:58.240
But now...

66
09:06.120 --> 09:10.379
Brother, when can we leave this place?

67
09:11.740 --> 09:13.620
I'm afraid that as time goes by,

68
09:14.899 --> 09:20.620
you'll start to believe the role you're playing.

69
09:30.259 --> 09:31.679
Of course not.

70
09:35.440 --> 09:39.353
What's real and what's fake,

71
09:40.879 --> 09:42.259
I can tell the difference.

72
09:45.919 --> 09:49.539
The one who ruined everything is Yu Zhong Quan.

73
09:52.179 --> 09:53.666
That's something...

74
09:55.360 --> 09:57.480
I will never forget.

75
10:25.220 --> 10:30.379
Bing Wen, I'm afraid I'll soon join your father.

76
10:30.379 --> 10:33.019
I've failed you both.

77
10:33.019 --> 10:36.820
You and Wan Qiao must live well.

78
10:36.820 --> 10:39.299
Bing Wen, remember this.

79
10:39.299 --> 10:41.279
Don't seek revenge.

80
10:41.279 --> 10:44.960
We can't afford to cross the Yu Army.

81
10:53.433 --> 10:55.080
Why is it raining so hard?

82
10:55.080 --> 10:57.039
How am I supposed to buy wine now?

83
10:58.419 --> 11:00.620
Damn dog. Quit barking!

84
11:00.620 --> 11:02.159
Keep it up, and I'll kill you!

85
11:05.800 --> 11:07.659
Father.

86
11:07.659 --> 11:09.173
Mother.

87
11:10.160 --> 11:11.870
Father.

88
11:11.870 --> 11:13.213
Mother.

89
11:35.880 --> 11:38.837
Mother, rest assured.

90
11:38.837 --> 11:41.586
I will avenge you.

91
13:42.299 --> 13:44.453
Master Chang Xuan, wait.

92
13:52.600 --> 13:54.013
What's the matter?

93
13:56.960 --> 14:01.679
There is something only you can help me with.

94
14:05.120 --> 14:07.160
You want me to release Jiang Xue Ting?

95
14:08.779 --> 14:10.166
Yes.

96
14:13.440 --> 14:14.726
Drive.

97
14:16.720 --> 14:18.253
Master Chang Xuan.

98
16:00.440 --> 16:01.779
Master Chang Xuan.

99
16:02.440 --> 16:07.299
Even if Xue Ting did write that report, he's barely been in the Yu Army.

100
16:07.299 --> 16:09.799
How would he know the high command's secrets?

101
16:09.799 --> 16:12.213
Someone must have used him.

102
16:17.679 --> 16:19.500
Are you sure you want my help?

103
16:24.559 --> 16:25.840
Yes.

104
16:27.480 --> 16:32.833
If you want a favor, you'd better show some humility.

105
16:44.019 --> 16:45.700
What do you want?

106
16:48.120 --> 16:53.000
From now on, cut all ties with Jiang Xue Ting.

107
16:53.000 --> 16:54.661
Stay by my side.

108
16:55.480 --> 17:00.360
As long as you agree, I can give you everything you want.

109
17:02.040 --> 17:04.719
Jiang Xue Ting and I are getting married.

110
17:07.720 --> 17:10.381
How can a dead man get married?

111
17:15.460 --> 17:16.819
Yu Chang Xuan.

112
17:18.560 --> 17:21.199
I can't believe I thought you'd changed.

113
17:22.200 --> 17:25.377
I thought there was still some goodness in you.

114
17:25.377 --> 17:29.700
I thought we could at least keep some decency between us.

115
17:30.519 --> 17:33.059
Yet you're still as incorrigible as ever.

116
17:33.059 --> 17:34.819
- Despic-- - Despicable.

117
17:34.819 --> 17:36.599
Shameless.

118
17:36.599 --> 17:38.359
Vile.

119
17:38.359 --> 17:39.740
What else?

120
17:41.559 --> 17:43.006
I'll take it all.

121
17:51.080 --> 17:56.759
I get what I want by any means necessary.

122
17:58.400 --> 18:00.453
All I care about is the result.

123
18:01.520 --> 18:03.726
Yu Chang Xuan, you're insane.

124
18:31.519 --> 18:32.799
Yes.

125
18:37.420 --> 18:38.920
I am insane.

126
18:44.220 --> 18:47.079
From the day I found this hairpin,

127
18:49.920 --> 18:52.499
I've kept it well hidden.

128
18:53.339 --> 18:58.640
No one was allowed to see it or touch it.

129
19:03.280 --> 19:04.840
I keep thinking that

130
19:06.520 --> 19:09.433
one day I'd return it to you myself...

131
19:15.160 --> 19:17.380
and put it on you with my own hands.

132
19:23.460 --> 19:25.140
You madman!

133
19:25.140 --> 19:26.660
Let go of me!

134
19:26.660 --> 19:28.000
Let go!

135
19:29.680 --> 19:32.040
You keep pushing me, over and over.

136
19:33.380 --> 19:36.220
Don't think I'm a patient man.

137
19:36.220 --> 19:38.480
Who keeps pushing whom, really?

138
19:39.420 --> 19:40.680
Don't do to others what you wouldn't want done to you.

139
19:40.680 --> 19:42.186
Do you understand?

140
19:43.680 --> 19:46.420
Don't get smart with me.

141
19:47.400 --> 19:49.680
I don't care what you want.

142
19:52.980 --> 19:58.200
All I know is that you're always in my head.

143
20:07.319 --> 20:09.633
Let go! Shameless!

144
20:17.059 --> 20:20.819
Good. I'll show you how shameless I can be.

145
20:58.080 --> 21:01.286
You don't really think this hairpin can kill me, do you?

146
21:07.759 --> 21:09.940
- Don't you dare! - Just watch me.

147
21:21.560 --> 21:27.706
You're going to such lengths to stay faithful to your man.

148
21:39.846 --> 21:42.506
When Jiang Xue Ting did those things,

149
21:43.680 --> 21:45.413
did he tell you?

150
21:49.440 --> 21:55.553
Did he ever worry you'd be implicated and put in danger?

151
22:05.240 --> 22:07.053
Anyway, I'm in no hurry.

152
22:09.900 --> 22:12.760
I'll see how long you can stay this stubborn.

153
22:12.760 --> 22:15.940
Jiang Xue Ting has been sentenced to death.

154
22:15.940 --> 22:21.279
When the time comes, be sure to give him a proper burial.

155
22:35.799 --> 22:37.273
Ye Ping Jun!

156
22:41.800 --> 22:43.333
What exactly do you want?

157
22:43.940 --> 22:45.819
What is it that I can't give you?

158
22:54.040 --> 22:56.680
I want pure love.

159
22:56.680 --> 23:00.800
A love with equality, respect, and devotion.

160
23:02.880 --> 23:04.099
Love?

161
23:05.359 --> 23:07.200
You're too naive.

162
23:08.040 --> 23:10.983
Even now, you still don't understand.

163
23:10.983 --> 23:12.859
In this world,

164
23:12.859 --> 23:17.539
the only thing that can protect you from danger and hardship

165
23:18.440 --> 23:20.400
is power and status.

166
23:24.720 --> 23:29.673
That's why I said we're from two different worlds.

167
23:32.120 --> 23:34.225
Listen carefully, Ye Ping Jun.

168
23:34.225 --> 23:35.846
Whether you like it or not,

169
23:37.660 --> 23:39.740
I, Yu Chang Xuan, will have you.

170
24:28.600 --> 24:32.040
[Xiangxi Hotel]

171
24:39.720 --> 24:44.820
Jin, use any more force, and you'll pull my arm off.

172
24:46.975 --> 24:50.079
The old wound barely heals, and now there's another.

173
24:50.079 --> 24:53.400
The old one kept reopening.

174
24:53.400 --> 24:55.360
It's practically a hole now.

175
24:55.360 --> 24:57.213
You almost damaged your bone.

176
24:59.599 --> 25:01.673
Which girl got the better of you?

177
25:04.160 --> 25:06.299
So what if she did?

178
25:06.299 --> 25:10.339
The Yu family's men are made of iron and steel.

179
25:22.880 --> 25:24.344
Keep the wound dry.

180
25:24.344 --> 25:26.206
I'll come back tomorrow.

181
25:28.839 --> 25:30.059
Get some rest.

182
25:39.640 --> 25:41.573
- Take care, Master Jin. - Take care.

183
25:47.220 --> 25:48.406
Salute!

184
25:51.079 --> 25:52.259
You're wounded.

185
25:52.980 --> 25:54.720
Look at you.

186
25:54.720 --> 25:58.760
I can tell how brutal the fight was and how hard it's been on you.

187
25:58.760 --> 26:02.820
But tell me, did you get what you wanted or not?

188
26:07.320 --> 26:08.779
Cut the crap.

189
26:08.779 --> 26:10.240
Don't get so worked up.

190
26:10.240 --> 26:11.779
I'm here to tell you something.

191
26:11.779 --> 26:14.660
Miss Ye went to the prison to visit that fellow.

192
26:14.660 --> 26:16.500
But I had her stopped.

193
26:20.960 --> 26:22.480
- Get out. - Officer.

194
26:22.480 --> 26:24.960
That traitor will be executed in three days.

195
26:24.960 --> 26:27.666
Just wait to collect his body. Why bother visiting him?

196
28:06.280 --> 28:07.646
Mom.

197
28:10.640 --> 28:12.080
Ping Jun.

198
28:12.759 --> 28:14.760
Did you see Xue Ting?

199
28:16.839 --> 28:18.140
No.

200
28:26.120 --> 28:30.619
How could Xue Ting do such a thing?

201
28:30.619 --> 28:35.159
Could there be some misunderstanding?

202
28:39.720 --> 28:41.960
What will his sentence be?

203
28:44.619 --> 28:46.220
Tell me.

204
28:50.140 --> 28:52.460
Just tell me.

205
28:56.640 --> 28:59.406
If the evidence is conclusive,

206
29:00.539 --> 29:04.680
he will face a firing squad in three days.

207
29:12.339 --> 29:16.079
Mom.

208
29:17.839 --> 29:20.839
Mom, don't scare me! Mom!

209
29:20.839 --> 29:22.490
Mom!

210
29:22.490 --> 29:24.400
Don't scare me, Mom!

211
29:24.400 --> 29:28.106
Mom, don't scare me! Mom!

212
29:29.440 --> 29:31.279
What is wrong with you? Hurry up! Come on!

213
29:31.279 --> 29:32.940
Auntie Zhao, don't pull me!

214
29:32.940 --> 29:35.839
This is a matter of life and death. Would it kill you to make a house call?

215
29:35.839 --> 29:38.840
Go take a look. Poor Ping Jun. She's crying her eyes out.

216
29:38.840 --> 29:42.223
It's not that I'm unwilling to go. I told you I can't treat her.

217
29:42.223 --> 29:44.700
Her condition requires a hospital run by foreigners.

218
29:44.700 --> 29:46.859
There's nothing more I can do.

219
29:46.859 --> 29:49.660
Poor things, left with no one to rely on. And Xue Ting has been arrested.

220
29:49.660 --> 29:53.220
Just think of it as good karma. See her again.

221
29:53.220 --> 29:55.099
It's a matter of life and death. Hurry!

222
29:55.099 --> 29:56.779
Ping Jun!

223
29:56.779 --> 29:58.360
The doctor is here!

224
29:58.360 --> 29:59.880
I said I can't treat her.

225
29:59.880 --> 30:02.099
- Don't make it difficult for me. - I...

226
30:02.880 --> 30:04.519
Who are you people?

227
30:04.519 --> 30:07.859
You can't go in there.

228
30:07.859 --> 30:09.466
You can't go in!

229
30:11.560 --> 30:12.814
Mom.

230
30:18.720 --> 30:22.503
Director Gu, what are you trying to do?

231
30:22.503 --> 30:26.313
In your mother's current state, she must be sent to the hospital.

232
30:33.080 --> 30:36.537
If you don't trust me, you can come with us.

233
30:36.537 --> 30:40.493
Whether we're here to help or harm you, you'll know once we get there.

234
31:23.240 --> 31:26.880
The doctor said your mother's condition is stable for now.

235
31:26.880 --> 31:29.691
I've told the hospital to give her the best care.

236
31:31.059 --> 31:33.186
You must be tired. Eat something first.

237
31:37.480 --> 31:40.933
Did Yu Chang Xuan send you to guard my house?

238
31:44.799 --> 31:46.846
He's only looking out for you, Miss Ye.

239
32:02.079 --> 32:03.339
Miss Ye.

240
32:04.019 --> 32:08.099
Chang Xuan always gets whatever he wants.

241
32:11.040 --> 32:13.093
Call me if you need anything.

242
32:28.339 --> 32:29.460
Wan Zhi.

243
32:30.400 --> 32:31.839
Wan Zhi.

244
32:31.839 --> 32:33.619
I'm so sorry.

245
32:34.279 --> 32:35.980
I'm so sorry.

246
32:36.599 --> 32:40.440
Xue Ting. Xue Ting, please stay safe.

247
32:40.440 --> 32:41.900
Xue Ting.

248
32:47.600 --> 32:50.739
By then, I'll rent a small house with a huge yard.

249
32:51.400 --> 32:53.240
It must have plenty of sunlight.

250
32:53.240 --> 32:57.200
That way, Auntie can enjoy the sun in the yard every day.

251
32:57.200 --> 33:03.113
And you... you can fill the yard with your favorite plantain lilies.

252
33:57.059 --> 33:58.559
Go, bite her!

253
34:57.640 --> 35:00.000
[Ward 13]

254
35:04.800 --> 35:06.146
Open the door.

255
35:09.240 --> 35:10.493
Get in!

256
35:40.120 --> 35:43.239
After Jiang Xue Ting went to jail, he asked for some books.

257
35:43.239 --> 35:45.400
I didn't see any harm, so I gave him some.

258
35:45.400 --> 35:46.600
You know what?

259
35:46.600 --> 35:48.680
Only three types of people come here.

260
35:48.680 --> 35:50.640
Those who cry and beg for mercy,

261
35:50.640 --> 35:54.204
those who keep talking tough, and those who want to die.

262
35:54.204 --> 35:58.739
I've never seen anyone like him, reading in a place like this.

263
35:58.739 --> 36:03.579
I have to say, he stays calm even in the face of doom.

264
36:03.579 --> 36:06.320
He's no ordinary man.

265
36:06.320 --> 36:09.679
It's a pity he leaked military secrets and defected to the enemy.

266
36:09.679 --> 36:13.340
Not even God could save him now.

267
36:32.400 --> 36:36.900
Miss Ye, your mother's lungs are very fragile.

268
36:36.900 --> 36:38.920
She needs absolute rest.

269
36:38.920 --> 36:40.960
She must remain calm.

270
36:40.960 --> 36:45.080
Otherwise, even the finest doctor alive couldn't help her.

271
37:05.900 --> 37:10.179
My dear, you're a smart person. Think about it.

272
37:10.179 --> 37:16.019
In Nanhuai City, is there anything Master Chang Xuan wants that he can't get?

273
37:16.019 --> 37:18.400
He's the favored son of heaven.

274
37:18.400 --> 37:23.820
If you keep resisting him, your man will suffer for it.

275
37:25.240 --> 37:29.039
And now, there's no way for you to escape.

276
37:29.039 --> 37:31.160
You might as well stay with him.

277
37:31.160 --> 37:34.019
In a few years, he'll let you go.

278
37:34.019 --> 37:35.940
You'll still be young by then.

279
37:35.940 --> 37:40.440
As for money, he'll make sure you're well provided for.

280
37:40.440 --> 37:42.940
Think about it carefully.

281
37:44.980 --> 37:49.400
Besides, Jiang Xue Ting is counting on you to save him.

282
37:49.400 --> 37:52.793
My dear, time is running out.

283
38:51.679 --> 38:53.133
Ping Jun.

284
38:57.480 --> 38:58.980
What's wrong?

285
39:10.300 --> 39:11.480
Mom.

286
39:12.159 --> 39:14.360
I have good news.

287
39:14.360 --> 39:17.360
Han Zhi's father found a friend.

288
39:18.080 --> 39:20.530
I'll be away for a while.

289
39:20.530 --> 39:23.719
I'm going to beg him to release Xue Ting.

290
39:25.260 --> 39:26.480
Really?

291
39:27.720 --> 39:30.006
Is he willing to help?

292
39:31.079 --> 39:32.639
Don't worry.

293
39:32.639 --> 39:35.300
Xue Ting will come back safe and sound.

294
40:06.880 --> 40:08.139
Miss Ye.

295
40:09.820 --> 40:11.419
Director Gu.

296
40:16.440 --> 40:19.220
Please take me to see Master Chang Xuan.

297
40:32.440 --> 40:38.320
[Maple Mansion]

298
41:27.780 --> 41:29.146
Have you thought it through?

299
41:29.995 --> 41:32.119
I'm already here.

300
41:32.119 --> 41:34.099
When will you release Jiang Xue Ting?

301
41:38.880 --> 41:42.353
Releasing a suspect like him won't be easy.

302
41:42.940 --> 41:44.679
The evidence is solid.

303
41:44.679 --> 41:46.519
There are procedures to follow.

304
41:47.119 --> 41:49.519
But I am a man of my word.

305
41:50.720 --> 41:52.479
He will come back alive.

306
41:55.179 --> 41:56.400
Alright.

307
41:57.599 --> 41:59.099
Then let's begin.
